    {
      "episode_number": 1,
      "title": "Chapter Seven: The Girl In The Rain",
      "start_node_id": "e1_n01",
      "default_ambient": "luxury_lounge",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "e1_n01",
          "type": "narrator",
          "text": "11:30 PM · Under an ironclad NDA, you've been ghostwriting for \"Client X\" for three weeks. Tonight he sends Chapter 7.",
          "style": "banner",
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "light",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n02"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n02",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "adrian",
          "text": "Writer—keep this chapter raw. Don't make me look like a hero. I wasn't one.",
          "timestamp_label": "11:30 PM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 650,
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "light",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n03"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n03",
          "type": "voice_note",
          "sender_id": "adrian",
          "duration_sec": 15,
          "transcript": "[low, haunted voice] Four years ago I broke the heart of the only woman I ever loved outside a train station in Boston. I told her she was holding back my startup—just to keep my father from ruining her family.",
          "audio_asset": null,
          "typing_delay_ms": 900,
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n04"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n04",
          "type": "narrator",
          "text": "Your breath catches. That voice. That train station. \"Client X\" is Adrian Thorne—the man who shattered you four years ago.",
          "style": "system_alert",
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n05"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n05",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "player",
          "text": "Wait... why didn't you ever tell her the truth about your father?",
          "timestamp_label": "11:32 PM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 0,
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "light",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n06"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n06",
          "type": "unsent_message",
          "sender_id": "adrian",
          "text": "Because by the time I beat my father, she had already disappeared.",
          "unsent_placeholder": "This message was unsent",
          "reveal_ms": 1900,
          "typing_delay_ms": 800,
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "medium",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n07"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n07",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "adrian",
          "text": "Because she deserved a clean break. Hang on... why are you typing like you know her?",
          "timestamp_label": "11:33 PM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 700,
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "light",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n08"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n08",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "Adrian has no idea the anonymous writer on his screen is YOU.",
          "options": [
            {
              "option_id": "opt_hide_id",
              "label": "Stay anonymous and ask if he still loves her",
              "cost_type": "free",
              "badge_text": null,
              "player_reply_text": "Just doing my job as your writer. If she stood in front of you tonight, what would you say?",
              "next_node_id": "e1_n09a"
            },
            {
              "option_id": "opt_vip_reveal",
              "label": "Drop the exact phrase only you two knew",
              "cost_type": "vip_rewarded",
              "badge_text": "VIP · Reveal",
              "player_reply_text": "You left out one detail, Adrian. You gave her your grey scarf at Platform 4.",
              "next_node_id": "e1_n09b"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n09a",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "adrian",
          "text": "I'd tell her I've kept every book she ever recommended on my nightstand for 1,460 nights.",
          "timestamp_label": "11:35 PM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 750,
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "medium",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n10"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n09b",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "adrian",
          "text": "...No one on earth knew about Platform 4. Rowan?! IS THAT YOU?!",
          "timestamp_label": "11:35 PM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 750,
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n10"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n10",
          "type": "cliffhanger",
          "headline": "The Ghostwriter's Secret.",
          "teaser_text": "Episode 2: Your phone rings—it's Adrian calling through the agency emergency line.",
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "ambient": "heartbeat",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_episode_number": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
